  "decision": {
    "descriptorProposed": false,
    "snapshotFilesWritten": false,
    "reason": "The official current survey selector exposes neither target upazila. Testing both observed thana-selector variants still returns only unrelated upazilas, and the published Dhaka hierarchy contains no Mymensingh district code. The separate public map-purchase catalog identifies nearby historical mouza/sheet products, and its public detail and thumbnail routes add no geometry, map extent, source unitcod, or feature count. A descriptor or fabricated tiny sheet response would fail the existing adapter’s completeness and identity checks.",
    "nextUsefulEvidence": "Obtain a legally/publicly accessible georeferenced RS/CS vector or map extent for Achargaon JL 86 and Kamaler Para JL 79, or a public archive selector that supplies exact unitcod and full-sheet GeoJSON; then test native Dag_No uniqueness and center intersection before proposing a descriptor."
  },
