    "finding": "Both official client flows obtain their available survey edition list from the same district-level GetSurveyListDistrictWise endpoint. Mymensingh returns only rsnum 201901 (RS digital survey); Gaibandha returns only rsnum 201901 (RS/BRS digital survey). No CS/SA historic rsnum appears in that public selector. The separate public purchase catalog labels historic CS/RS products but exposes no matching numeric rsnum or parcel API. The live Dhaka hierarchy has no Mymensingh district row."
